e more  exaggerated brush it with some egg wash  now we're going to cut some slits and  what this does is help the steam release  as it's cooking  so you don't end up with a soggy top put  this in the freezer for 20 minutes to  harden back up and then we'll put in the  oven for 80 to 90 minutes until these  juices are bubbling and thick so the  apple pie is in the oven it smells great  i cannot wait but to make it even more  epic we're gonna add a thick gooey  caramel sauce on top first we're  starting with sugar and water to make it  even more foolproof i'm going to add a  little bit of corn syrup it helps  prevent crystallization  and it will also keep that really glossy  shine that we want for the top of our  pie now that everything is in the pot  you're gonna bring it to a low boil and  cook it until it turns a light copper  color so i say caramel  some people might say caramel  caramel  wait what am i saying caramel caramel  like it sounds very blunt to me caramel  caramel caramel caramel  so this looks perfect it's like the  color of a copper penny we're going to  turn off the heat and add all the heavy  cream it's going to boil up so don't be  scared keep stirring until all the cream  is incorporated i'm just gonna let it  cool and then we'll top our pie with it  all right guys it is out of the oven  it's beautiful the last step is to pour  this delicious caramel sauce over the  top we're just gonna let it drip down  the sides oh my god it's so thick it's  glossy from that corn syrup the last  step is these candied pecans it is  finished it is smile high the sauce is  dripping off i cannot wait to try this  that is some serious pie the crust is  the best part like i'm a sucker for  crispy crust and this is like it's  buttery i could just eat the crust and  the caramel sauce alright well that is  it for us today we have made a six  minute a 60 minute and a six hour apple  pie i hope you guys make them and love  them as much as i do leave a comment  below and let us know what you think and  just remember there is always time for  apple pie  oh yes  [Music]  you

